----------------------------------------------------------------
Actor gen_type_reference_table .
----------------------------------------------------------------

C Artifact element-types-reference quick reference
C O Complete reference for all element type keywords and their behaviors.
C
C Section type_summary 2 Element Type Summary
C D
C D | Type | Scope | Resolution | Navigation |
C D |------|-------|------------|------------|
C D | `key` | Local | Immediate | Field access only |
C D | `word` | Local | Immediate | Field access only |
C D | `text` | Local | Immediate | Field access only |
C D | `number` | Local | Immediate | Field access only |
C D | `ref` | Global | Pass 1 | `Its field actor` |
C D | `link` | Sibling | Pass 1 | `Its field actor` |
C D | `ref_copy` | Previous | Pass 2+ | `Its field actor` |
C D | `ref_child` | Parent→Child | Pass 2+ | `Its field actor` |
C D | `up_copy` | Ancestor | Pass 2+ | `Its field actor` |
C D | `type_of` | Child by type | Pass 2+ | `Its field actor` |
C D | `tree` | Local | Immediate | `Its field.up/down/left/right actor` |
C D
C Section type_resolution_passes 2 Multi-Pass Resolution Details
C D
C D **Pass 1: Direct References**
C D - `ref`: Global lookup by key in Find index
C D - `link`: Parent-scoped lookup by key in FindIn index
C D
C D **Pass 2+: Derived References**
C D - `ref_copy`: Copy pointer from previous resolved field
C D - `ref_child`: Look up child in previously resolved parent
C D - `up_copy`: Walk parent chain to ancestor type
C D - `type_of`: Match child by component type name
C D
C D The loader continues passes until all references resolve or error count stabilizes.
C

Break

